			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Guide\n\n1. After [[Solve the Dark Room puzzle.canvas|Solve the Dark Room puzzle]] and during a run you did that.\n2. If you have the Magnifying Lens item, you can search on the photos inside that room for a number carved into a tree.\n3. This number is 1128, this is used to unlock the padlock on the [[Apple Orchard.canvas|Apple Orchard]], granting a permanent bonus of 20 steps at the start of every run and also granting you access to that area.",
